NFL/data/processed/
NFL/data/raw/*
!NFL/data/raw/odds_api_line_movement/
# Frozen historical seed data (2021-2025 seasons, pre-2026 team games/schedules).
# Static and never rebuilt in CI; scripts/15 and scripts/57 read these directly
# with no fallback, so they must be tracked or the nfl.yml "publish" job fails
# on every run (confirmed: readRDS "cannot open the connection" on both files).
!NFL/data/raw/player_stats_2021_2025.rds
!NFL/data/raw/team_games.rds
!NFL/data/raw/schedules.rds
NFL/outputs/
dfs-engine/data/raw/
dfs-engine/data/reports/

